{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S01、S05这类只有18至19秒的短段，Y的感受短语仍然偏密，即使字号较小，也容易让观众在话与感受之间来回切换。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把心理变化中真正重要的词组加亮，观众不用读完每句话，也能抓住从害怕给对方负担、逐渐放松、暴露心意、害怕失去到决定不再隐藏的过程，人物行为的前因后果更容易被看见。更重要的是，Y把不少感受安排在音乐对应的小节出现，水波、呼吸、音色、身体感和情绪起伏不再只是一堆并列形容词，而是有了发生的时机和变化的过程；因此前后连贯性和细腻程度都更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2e93a544-560d-4beb-93db-c739717e4e96", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T005004547072Z", "elapsed_seconds": 77.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:51:21.772612+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "38bae0b5689364838657fbd21c60db512d7f111399fc96da6e41ccddf337998f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at